Prime Minister. But actually, the chaos really continues into the election campaign. So, the very first meeting of his election team tom has to be moved from room to room because marcia williams who played such a leading role in the last episode she's very keen that her nemesis in his high command to her joe haynes his press secretary and bernard donahue is his policy chief i mean to be fair they have been plotting to murder her they have right but But they've been discussing plotting to murder her. They haven't actually been plotting. I think that's semantic.
首相之后。但实际上，混乱确实延续到了竞选活动中。所以，汤姆，他的竞选团队的第一次会议不得不从一个房间换到另一个房间，因为在上一集中扮演了重要角色的玛西娅·威廉姆斯（Marcia Williams），她非常希望她在高层指挥部的克星——她的新闻秘书乔·海恩斯（Joe Haynes）和政策主管伯纳德·多诺霍（Bernard Donoghue）——公平地说，他们一直在密谋除掉她，他们确实有，对吧？但他们一直在讨论密谋除掉她。他们并没有真正实施。我认为那是语义问题。

13
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:51.000
She doesn't want them to come to the meetings. She keeps changing the room behind their back. Right. So that sort of behavior. Also, Wilson gets tanked up on brandy before his first TV broadcast. So there's that sort of sense of general seediness and shabbiness in one answer. So Wilson's having all kinds of trouble with Marcia. What about, so there's Tony Benn, who's been kicking up all kinds of, basically is foisting
她不想让他们参加会议。她背着他们不断更换房间。对。就是那种行为。此外，威尔逊在第一次电视广播前喝了白兰地。所以，总的来说，有一种普遍的肮脏和破败感。所以威尔逊在玛西娅身上遇到了各种麻烦。那么，托尼·本（Tony Benn）呢，他一直在制造各种麻烦，基本上是强加

14
00:07:51.000 --> 00:08:11.000
policies on Wilson that he doesn't really want. That's right. Wilson doesn't really want to go into that election with any policies at all, Tom, because Wilson's great thing. You said about people being bored. Wilson wants people to be bored because his promise is, I will give you a quiet life. No more conflict with the unions. We've got our lovely social contract, which fans of Russo will remember from the last
给威尔逊一些他并不真正想要的政策。没错。威尔逊并不真的想带着任何政策进入那场选举，汤姆，因为威尔逊最看重的是。你刚才说人们感到厌倦。威尔逊希望人们感到厌倦，因为他的承诺是：我会给你们平静的生活。不再与工会发生冲突。我们有可爱的社会契约，Russo的粉丝们会记得上一集的内容，我们基本上会给工会他们想要的工资协议。然后我们会给他们很多额外的福利，比如健康和安全方面的东西。作为回报，他们会缓和未来的工资要求。另一方面，托尼·本是国有化、国家企业委员会、国家规划的伟大信徒，

15
