episode, where we will basically give the unions the pay deals they want. And we will then give them lots of extra goodies like health and safety stuff and all these things. And in return, they will moderate their future pay demands. Tony Benn, on the other hand, is the great apostle of nationalization, of a national enterprise board, of state planning
以及所有这些东西。他是那个伟大的“妖怪”。威尔逊基本上试图在整个竞选期间把他关在盒子里。而且一直有各种故事传到工党高层，

16
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:39.000
and all this stuff. And he's the great bogeyman. And Wilson basically tries to keep him in a box throughout the election campaign. And there are all these stories that keep coming into Labour High Command
说报纸正在准备关于托尼·本的惊人揭露，说他是瘾君子。哦，真的吗？因为，我的意思是，托尼·本是最节制的人，不是吗？他是。他滴酒不沾。

17
00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:48.000
that the newspapers are preparing these amazing revelations about Tony Benn, that he's a drug addict. Oh, really? Because, I mean, Tony Benn is the most abstemious of men, isn't he? He is. He's a teetotaler.
他喜欢喝茶。他非常喜欢喝茶。但仅此而已。而且，正如我们在《历史的余味》第二次历史版“恋爱岛”中发现的那样，他非常爱他的妻子卡罗琳。这是伟大的政治爱情故事之一。但报纸显然也准备了这个故事，说他正在一个叫比肯霍尔公馆（Bickenhall Mansions）的地方参加狂欢派对，那是在马里波恩（Marleybone）的一个爱德华时代公寓大楼。

18
