Sunday Mirror editor passed the story to Harold Wilson and Wilson called Ben in and he said, sort of smoked his pipe at him and said, is it true? Have you been taking part in orgies in these? And Ben was very offended by this because obviously he hadn't. Well, he would be, of course. And is this the point where the tabloids really start going after Tony Benn? Because from this point on, he will be the great hate object, won't he? He's the kind of the standard bearer of what the tabloids call the loony left.
是的。所以他们在大约10年后才真正创造出“疯狂左派”这个词，但在这一点上，他们绝对称他为政委、布尔什维克，诸如此类。实际上，威尔逊在接下来的几周竞选活动中，竭尽全力把本藏在一张巨大的毯子下。所以这一切都非常、非常鼓舞人心。与此同时，爱德华·希思（Edward Heath）呢？嗯，泰德·希思的粉丝们可能不会喜欢上一集，因为他缺席了。他去生闷气了。他被击败了。我认为公平地说，泰德·希思是进入1974年10月竞选时最彻底的失败者，

