Yes. So they don't really coin the loony left phrase for another 10 years, but absolutely at this point, they're calling him a commissar, a Bolshevik, all this kind of thing. And actually, Wilson goes out of his way to sort of basically hide Ben under a massive blanket for the next few weeks during the election campaign. So that's all very, very inspiring. And meanwhile, what about Edward Heath? Well, so Ted Heath, fans of Ted Heath will have not enjoyed the previous episode because he was absent. He was off sulking. He's been defeated. I think it's fair to say Ted Heath is the most busted of busted flushes going into the
因为他从没想过自己会输，汤姆，那第一次选举。现在我知道这对你来说是一个悲伤的时刻，因为你是索尔兹伯里人。泰德·希思当然以住在索尔兹伯里而闻名，一个伟大的威尔特郡人。我不知道你是否喜欢游艇和弹钢琴之类的东西。我不喜欢游艇，不。但他的游艇撞毁了，不是吗？在选举前几个月。是的，他极其倒霉。希思患有未确诊的甲状腺疾病。他的游艇“晨云号”（Morning Cloud）在怀特岛沉没，船上两人死亡。其中一人是他的教子。所以这是一件非常糟糕的事情。

21
